{"id":"n44484-1-15","stage":0,"title":"덥다 · 热","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44484-1-15-1","ko":"무슨 땀을 그렇게 많이 흘리니?","zh":"你怎么会流这么多汗啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땀을","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흘리니?","meaning":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，流淌，淌出来；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"5","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"汗液、眼泪、鼻涕、血、口水等液体从体内排出。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/972cc992417d16c34d52.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44484-1-15-2","ko":"운동을 했더니 더워서 그래.","zh":"因为刚做了运动，所以很热。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더워서","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/dfe187dd410daeab7297.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.8,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=44484","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":19,"sequenceScore":0.9336,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你怎么会流这么多汗啊？","因为刚做了运动，所以很热。","工作好像不会很快结束吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么会流这么多汗啊？","因为刚做了运动，所以很热。","工作好像不会很快结束吧？"],"answer":1}]}
